{"product":{"id":8049346838606,"title":"Men's Office Classics Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three refined fragrances made for effortless everyday wear — a versatile woody leather, a fresh modern green wood, and a warm mineral-woody classic. Three miniatures that showcase timeless sophistication and office-ready versatility before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMontblanc Explorer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, pink pepper, and clary sage over patchouli and Ambrofix, settling into vetiver, leather, and cedarwood — versatile, confident, and polished.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBois Impérial\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is Thai basil and Timut pepper over Haitian vetiver, Georgywood, and Petalia, settling into Akigalawood, patchouli, and Ambrofix — fresh, green, and sophisticated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTerre d'Hermès Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is grapefruit and shiso over cedarwood, settling into a warm woody accord — elegant, earthy, and distinguished.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree office-ready classics, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover your next signature scent.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-03T16:44:12+05:30","handle":"mens-office-classics-sample-set-terre-dhermes-parfum-bois-imperial-montb